WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
If you're on a split dose prep, it's time to walk through your second dose.

2
00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:08.890
Confirm with your written instructions. Split dosing means you take the first

3
00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:09.520
half of your

4
00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:13.680
prep the evening before and the second half the morning of your procedure,

5
00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:14.880
typically six hours

6
00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:19.420
before your arrival time. When you wake up tomorrow, mix and drink your second

7
00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:20.560
dose as directed on

8
00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.850
your prep instructions. Continue drinking clear liquids after your dose until

9
00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:25.600
the cutoff time

10
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:30.170
we've specified. Your goal is to keep going until your output runs clear. That

11
00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:31.280
's how we know your

12
00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:35.510
prep is working. If you have any concerns about how things are going, call our

13
00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:36.480
office first thing

14
00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:38.240
in the morning. You're almost done.
